<Positioned left="54" top="834"><Text fontSize="20" color="#475569FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">净收入 = gross_revenue − refund_amount；经营利润 = 净收入 − operating_cost。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="54" top="860"><Text fontSize="20" color="#475569FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">退款率 = refund_amount ÷ gross_revenue；转化率 = orders ÷ sessions。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="54" top="886"><Text fontSize="20" color="#475569FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">本轮使用 CSV 原始数据，未做任何人工调整。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="54" top="912"><Text fontSize="20" color="#475569FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">总体转化率按全部 6 个月的 orders 合计 ÷ sessions 合计计算，不是各月转化率的平均；表格与柱高来自同一份计算结果。</Text></Positioned>
